flowchart LR
    SensorTask -->|overwrite latest sample| xDisplayQueue --> DisplayTask
    SensorTask -->|independent latest sample| xAlarmQueue --> AlarmTask
    InputTask -->|overwrite selected mode| xModeQueue --> DisplayTask
    xDisplayQueue -. queue set .-> xDisplayEvents[xDisplayEvents]
    xModeQueue -. queue set .-> xDisplayEvents
    DisplayTask -->|owns I2C writes| OLED[SSD1306]
    MotionTask -->|set or clear MOTION| Events[xSystemEvents]
    StateTask -->|set or clear ACTIVE| Events
    AlarmTask -->|set or clear ALARM| Events
    AnyTask[Any task logging] -->|one complete line| Mutex[serialMutex] --> UART[USART1]
